# Deploy via PR

Self-contained product/infra fixes (UI polish, API fixes, docs, tests) **commit → push → PR** and follow GitOps. Do not stop at a local commit when the change is ready to ship.

Flow: **PR → CI Gate → Auto-merge → CI Images → Argo sync → Verify Dev**.

- Do not ask “commit?” again if the user already said to deploy / PR / ship.
- Do not bypass GitOps (`kubectl apply`, manual migrate, local-only “done”).
- Keep `tools/_*.sh` and secrets out of the PR.
- If CI Gate fails, fix on the same PR branch and push; wait for green Verify Dev before declaring done.
